{"id": "t056-001", "text": "so just talked to khadija her sister lin is moving to leeds on the 14th of may and she's um she's pretty anxious about it because she doesn't know anyone up there remind me to text lin the week before oh and khadija said their mum's going up with her for the first weekend to help unpack so she won't be totally on her own at least", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lin", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th of may", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text lin", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lin", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
